@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
Idle : entry / Initial state

state AdjustingTime <<choice>>
AdjustingTime : entry / User presses button to adjust time
AdjustingTime : do / Increase values while adjusting time settings
AdjustingTime : exit / Time adjusted successfully

state AlarmSetting <<choice>>
AlarmSetting : entry / User turns on or off alarm feature
AlarmSetting : do / Set alarm hour and minutes
AlarmSetting : exit / Alarm set successfully

state AlarmTriggered
AlarmTriggered : entry / Set alarm time matches current time
AlarmTriggered : do / Trigger alarm to ring
AlarmTriggered : exit / Alarm stopped by user

state LightOn <<choice>>
LightOn : entry / User presses button to turn on light
LightOn : do / Turn on light feature
LightOn : exit / Light turned off when button released

Idle --> AdjustingTime : press button to adjust time
AdjustingTime --> Idle : time adjusted successfully
AdjustingTime --> AlarmSetting : press button to switch to alarm setting
AlarmSetting --> Idle : alarm set successfully
AlarmSetting --> AlarmTriggered : alarm triggered
AlarmTriggered --> LightOn : light on when alarm triggered
LightOn --> AlarmTriggered : stop alarm by pressing specific button
AlarmTriggered --> Idle : alarm stopped

Idle --> [*] : power off
@enduml
